# ── Media ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# song.mp3 and october.md ARE committed here.
#
# They hold a copyrighted recording and its lyrics, so they were excluded while
# this repository's visibility was unconfirmed. It is private — nothing is being
# distributed publicly — so they are tracked, and a clone runs complete.
#
# IF THIS REPOSITORY IS EVER MADE PUBLIC, remove them from tracking first:
#   git rm --cached song.mp3 october.md
#   …then restore the two ignore lines below.
# Publishing them would mean redistributing someone else's work under this
# repository's name, and a DMCA takedown removes the whole repo, not just the
# offending files.
#
# song.mp3
# october.md

